Good. Since you’re using Astro + Supabase, I’d structure questions in layers:
Business clarity
User behavior
Data structure (critical for Supabase)
SEO & content
Monetization
Security & scale
Workflow & ownership
Below is exactly how I’d interview a client as a serious web developer.
1️⃣ Business & Outcome Questions (CEO Level)
These define the entire architecture.
Vision
What is the primary goal of this site?
Lead generation?
Directory?
SaaS?
Content authority?
Affiliate revenue?
What does “success” look like in 6 months?
Revenue
How will this site make money?
Ads?
Affiliate?
Subscriptions?
Featured listings?
Lead resale?
What is the fastest path to first revenue?
Audience
Who is the exact target user?
Tourists?
Locals?
Business owners?
Investors?
What problem are we solving for them?
2️⃣ User Experience & Behavior
This determines front-end structure in Astro.
User Actions
What are the top 3 actions users must be able to do?
Search?
Filter?
Book?
Submit?
Contact?
Should users log in?
Should businesses log in?
Should there be reviews?
Flow
What is the ideal homepage journey?
What should happen after someone clicks a listing?
Should there be saved favorites?
3️⃣ Data Architecture (Supabase Critical)
This is where most projects fail if not clarified early.
Core Entities
What data types exist?
Listings?
Categories?
Tags?
Blog posts?
Users?
Reviews?
Leads?
Structure
Do listings belong to multiple categories?
Do we need:
Many-to-many relationships?
Location-based filtering?
Geolocation (lat/long)?
Will businesses manage their own listing?
Data Input
How does data get added?
Manual?
Admin dashboard?
API import?
Scraped?
4️⃣ Content & SEO (Astro Strength)
Astro is elite for SEO. I’d ask:
What pages need to rank?
Are we targeting local keywords?
Do we need:
Programmatic SEO pages?
Dynamic category pages?
Dynamic location pages?
Will blog content live in:
Markdown?
Supabase?
Do we need schema markup (LocalBusiness, FAQ, etc.)?
5️⃣ Admin & Workflow
Who manages the site?
Do we need:
Admin dashboard?
Role-based permissions?
Should we use:
Supabase Auth?
Magic link login?
Should listings require approval before publishing?
6️⃣ Monetization Architecture
If it's a directory or service site:
Free listings + paid featured?
Stripe integration?
Subscription tiers?
Lead tracking per listing?
Analytics dashboard for businesses?
7️⃣ Security & Compliance
Will we collect user data?
Need:
Terms & privacy?
GDPR?
Rate limiting?
Should Supabase Row Level Security (RLS) be enabled?
Do businesses see only their own data?
8️⃣ Scalability & Future
What happens if traffic 10x’s?
Will this expand beyond one location?
Should database structure support:
Multiple cities?
Multiple verticals?
Do we anticipate mobile app later?
9️⃣ Design Direction
Minimal or bold?
Competitors you like?
Color direction?
Should it feel:
Authority?
Fun?
Premium?
Local?